        border-radius: 1.25rem;
        padding: .45rem;
        background:
            radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0, color-mix(in srgb, var(--gtx-accent-solid, #1e73be) 9%, transparent), transparent 28rem),
            linear-gradient(145deg, #f8fafc, #e8eef5);
        box-shadow:
